WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:02.878
With his newspaper. Lisbeth is in an upmarket tailors.

2
00:00:03.045 --> 00:00:08.383
The tailor shows her a leather motorcycle jacket he's made
from a photo of Mikael wearing an identical garment.

3
00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.768
She looks surprised by the tailor's comment.

4
00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:22.606
Back at her apartment, she writes a card
which has a picture of a horse on it

5
00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:24.233
and put it in an envelope.

6
00:00:32.658 --> 00:00:34.409
She addresses the envelope to ‘M’.

7
00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:35.577
Night.

8
00:00:35.911 --> 00:00:40.207
Lisbeth rides her motorcycle down a cobbled street
with snow piled at the curbside.

9
00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:48.131
She parks on a corner outside Mikael's apartment

10
00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:49.383
and removes her crash helmet.

11
00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:52.302
She takes a package from the back of the bike,

12
00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:56.765
but stops dead when she sees Mikael
leave his apartment with Erika.

13
00:01:00.102 --> 00:01:03.605
She watches numbly as the couple walk away
with their arms around each other.

14
00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:21.915
Lisbeth looks down as Mikael and Erika
get into a waiting taxi.

15
00:01:27.504 --> 00:01:32.676
Lisbeth turns away and flings the package which has the card
attached to it into a nearby dumpster.

16
00:01:33.552 --> 00:01:35.220
She puts her crash helmet back on,

17
00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:36.138
gets on her bike

18
00:01:36.138 --> 00:01:36.972
and starts it up.

19
00:01:37.723 --> 00:01:40.601
A solitary figure, she rides off into the night.